OL,3,GNEWSAThe unsafe school that left
OL,4,Aparents in tears
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambois Primary School is one of only
OL,7,Fseven in England to get the lowest
OL,8,FOfsted grading in the past year and
OL,9,Fparents have told the BBC the
OL,10,FNorthumberland school is a nightmare.
OL,11,FWhat is going on?
OL,13,FAs she walked out of the school gates
OL,14,Fin June, Kayleigh was in tears.
OL,16,FShe had been scouting out Cambois'
OL,17,FSpecialist Support Base (SSB) for her
OL,18,Fson, who is non-verbal, but was
OL,19,F"absolutely disgusted" with what she
OL,20,Ffound.
